```rst
NCCL_SOCKET_IFNAME
-----------------
Specifies which IP interface to use for communication. The value can be a comma-separated list of prefixes.
Prefix a token with ``^`` to exclude matching interfaces. Prefix a token with ``=`` to request an exact interface name.

NCCL_SOCKET_FAMILY
------------------
Forces the IP family used by sockets. Accepted values are ``AF_INET`` and ``AF_INET6``.
```
